[0.136, "o", "ai-context [aic] (v0.0.1) — Generate AI assistant context files with foundation documentation and project analysis.\r\ngit-aliases [ga] (v0.0.1) — Curated Git aliases with safe install/uninstall via ~/.gitconfig include.\r\njump-dir [jd] (v0.0.7) — Create directory shortcuts and jump to them via a shell function (jd).\r\nprompt (v0.1.1) — Install a safe, preset-based shell prompt with optional mindful reminders.\r\nzip-project [zp] (v0.0.1) — Create a share-friendly zip of a project for LLM review (ChatGPT/Claude/etc.).\r\n"]
